   "text": "ties later in the scan can never be closer to the top:\nsame size + bigger row  \u21d2  lower square. Strict '>' is the whole tie-break.\n\ntotal work: rows \u00d7 cols cell visits = 48 \u2014 you cannot beat reading the map once.",
